            "description": {
              "value": "When you enter your SoM, you disperse the magical reinforcement to nearby allies. You grant the extra damage of SoM in an aura affecting all allies in a 5-foot emanation. This uses only the base damage of the stance, based on the ally's weapon specialization; it doesn't use any increase you get from bonuses, the laughing shadow hybrid study, or the like. As normal for duplicate effects, multiple SoM affecting the same creature aren't cumulative."
